apply for their videos

00:05:13.234 --> 00:05:14.601
to be marked as reliable.

00:05:14.601 --> 00:05:15.767
-Ooh!
-Yeah.

00:05:15.767 --> 00:05:18.000
YouTube finally looked at
all their misinformation

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.133
on their site and said...

00:05:19.133 --> 00:05:20.667
-Ain't nobody got time for that.

00:05:20.667 --> 00:05:22.667
-Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:27.634 --> 00:05:29.901
So now people who
post fake information online

00:05:29.901 --> 00:05:31.334
are freaking out, like...

00:05:31.334 --> 00:05:33.067
-[ Bleating loudly ]

00:05:33.067 --> 00:05:35.067
-Because if they keep
spreading lies,

00:05:35.067 --> 00:05:37.400
YouTube might step in
and stop them, kind of like...

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:40.067
-The question is, how do
democracies respond to...

00:05:40.067 --> 00:05:41.801
-And what will it mean for...

00:05:41.801 --> 00:05:44.834
-But people need to know which
sources to trust

00:05:44.834 --> 00:05:46.634
or they could fall
for anything, like...

00:05:49.667 --> 00:05:52.534
-Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh!

00:05:52.534 --> 00:05:56.100
-Or they might jump to wrong
conclusions, kind of like...

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:58.834
♪♪

00:05:58.834 --> 00:05:59.968
-♪ Sail ♪

00:05:59.968 --> 00:06:04.734
-So if you're spreading
misinformation,

00:06:04.734 --> 00:06:06.701
